Package: 1bit-openwebui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: 1bit <packages@1bit.gg>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: 1bit-lemonade
Suggests: podman | docker.io
Description: OpenWebUI chat front end for 1bit OS (optional)
 The other chat front end (engine#594): the upstream OpenWebUI container,
 run against this box's Lemonade API on 127.0.0.1:13305 with the key
 Lemonade already has, listening on 8080. The console and the menu name
 the URL while it answers.
 .
 It is optional and nothing depends on it: it is not in the image, apt
 installs it, and the unit it ships is enabled by this package's own
 preset. The container runtime is only Suggests, so the package installs
 on a box with no Ubuntu archive and no network; the unit then fails
 loudly without holding the boot.
